        <mxCell id="title" value="PAS · sequence · 8 · Workflow configuration — new version, activation swap, running instances unaffected" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="18" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caption" value="4.7 &quot;quy trình phê duyệt không được hard-code&quot; · UC Quản trị hệ thống → Cấu hình workflow · permission workflow:configure · db-workflow's definition/instance split. The admin-facing half of seq-03." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;fontColor=#777777;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="1280" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Lifeline shapes — stick figure = actor (human role) · circle with left bar = boundary (system edge: gateway, external provider) · circle with rim arrow = control (relay, scheduler) · circle on a line = entity (datastore or broker: Postgres schema, Redis, Kafka) · plain rectangle = one of the nine PAS services.     Arrows — solid filled = sync request (gRPC service-to-service per D16; REST for user or external traffic) · dashed open = response · purple open = broker publish/delivery · self-call = local work ('tx:' ⇒ commits atomically)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;spacing=8;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3288" width="1180" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
